{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000006"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Well, I'm not saying never ask how are you. Call two, three, ask about the wife, the kids, the dog, it works there. But on a call one,", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005"}, {"quote": "A stranger asking how are you doesn't sound like a care. It sounds like a start of the pitch. Will you get back?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000006"}], "text": "In the first call with a client, asking 'how are you?' can sound insincere and like the start of a sales pitch, putting the client on guard and making it harder to have a genuine conversation."}, "title": "Problem with Asking 'How are you?' in Initial Calls", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:140fa295a34f7b5a", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Problem with Asking 'How are you?' in Initial Calls", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy", "topic_slug": "initial-call-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Are you interested in investing in Dubai real estate? How I can help you? And what's the problem here?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007"}, {"quote": "So the moment you say you're interested in investing in Dubai real estate, the natural reaction is to correct you.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008"}, {"quote": "Have you been to Dubai? Do you like Dubai? Many agents believe that if the client has visited or especially more than once.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009"}, {"quote": "you like to invest? Now the client freezes because in reality he's not maybe downtown Dubai Marina, maybe one or two more.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000010"}], "text": "Agents often start calls by assuming that the client wants to buy, leading clients to correct them or freeze due to lack of information, which can kill the deal."}, "title": "Common Mistakes in Initial Questions", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:0b56c0f9b1d231cb", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Common Mistakes in Initial Questions", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy", "topic_slug": "initial-call-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000021", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000022", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000023"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Because they're afraid to upset or displease the client. But as soon as the agents in my coaching start digging into the problem, in the intent, into motivation, they switch on something inside the client.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000021"}, {"quote": "things need to happen for a deal to close. One is internal urgency. Not not the urgency you create a last unit or price will go up.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000022"}], "text": "Agents should ask questions to understand the client's intent and motivations rather than making assumptions or pushing for immediate decisions."}, "title": "Questions to Understand Client's Intent", "topic": "Client Engagement"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:420120f5f18ae948", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Questions to Understand Client's Intent", "topic": "Client Engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000017"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "self_report", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "The strongest influence on my work was my mentorship with Jeremy Minor and his narrow emotional persuasion method. I didn't copy it, I rebuilt it for realities of Dubai real estate.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000017"}], "text": "The speaker rebuilt Jeremy Minor's narrow emotional persuasion method for Dubai real estate."}, "title": "Narrow Emotional Persuasion Method", "topic": "Sales Techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:587a7ef7c78574e9", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Narrow Emotional Persuasion Method", "topic": "Sales Techniques", "topic_slug": "sales-techniques"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000003", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000004", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000005", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000006", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000007", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000008", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000009"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": {"citations": [{"quote": "What broke the deal is the way you talk to him in the first seconds of the call.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002"}], "text": "The problem lies in asking the same series of questions that provide no real value or connection to clients, leading them to withdraw."}, "kind": "demonstration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "just send me some options. If you're selling to buy real estate, you've heard it two free time on a course this week, or maybe even this day.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001"}], "text": "Real estate agents frequently lose deals after the first call when clients disappear after being asked standard opening questions."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "Change that and the next month you will double your sales.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002"}], "text": "Agents should change their approach to communication to potentially double their sales within the next month."}, "title": "Common Mistakes in Initial Client Calls", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:ec09c98c8e76a6ef", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Common Mistakes in Initial Client Calls", "topic": "Initial Call Strategy", "topic_slug": "initial-call-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000017", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000018"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "reported_exchange", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Quick example. John joined my coaching academy already closing deals, but only with people he knew personally.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000017"}], "text": "John, a participant in the coaching academy, was closing deals only with people he knew personally but struggled with new leads from social media."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "We fixed the structure of his conversations. And just after one session, he went back to his own leads and closed two deals on the first month.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000018"}], "text": "By fixing the structure of his conversations, John improved his control over new leads."}, "title": "Reported Case of Agent Coaching", "topic": "Coaching Impact"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:7d9bb971884306c7", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Reported Case of Agent Coaching", "topic": "Coaching Impact", "topic_slug": "coaching-impact"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000002"], "form": "structure", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "and this is exact reason you're losing deals, because after you send them even the perfect options, the client just disappears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000001"}], "text": "The speaker starts with an illustrative scenario of a common issue, explains why it happens, and proposes a solution that challenges common assumptions."}, "purpose": null, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Explaining Concept of Client Disappearance", "topic": "Client Engagement"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:0fc430285fd838b8", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Explaining Concept of Client Disappearance", "topic": "Client Engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000019", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000020"], "form": "rhetorical_move", "observation": {"citations": [{"quote": "there are only two types of agents. The first are people pleasers and order takers.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000019"}], "text": "The speaker contrasts people pleasers and order takers with expert agents, highlighting different approaches and their outcomes."}, "purpose": {"citations": [{"quote": "if you recognize yourself for the first category, you can shift to become an expert as well.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000020"}], "text": "To encourage agents to shift towards being experts who lead conversations."}, "speaker_id": "1", "title": "Contrasting Two Types of Agents", "topic": "Agent Types"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:expression:6c0dcf75ead35515", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "expression", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Contrasting Two Types of Agents", "topic": "Agent Types", "topic_slug": "agent-types"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "So the client reaches clarity himself.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "The client reaches clarity himself."}, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "This is where most agents go wrong. They pitch too early, recommend too early, present properties before the client understands his own decisions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "Most agents pitch or recommend properties too early before the client understands their own decisions."}, "title": "Client Clarity", "topic": "sales strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:98d4afd49f7bab7d", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client Clarity", "topic": "sales strategy", "topic_slug": "sales-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000028", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000029"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "claim", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "But your tone must be curious.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000028"}, {"quote": "read it in a monotone and you will get a completely different answer.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000029"}], "text": "The tone of a conversation affects the responses clients give, implying that curiosity in tone can elicit more revealing answers."}, "title": "Tone and Interaction", "topic": "communication skills"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:31b15f09edefc829", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Tone and Interaction", "topic": "communication skills", "topic_slug": "communication-skills"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000037"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "He needs to realize there is something important he doesn't yet understand about choosing the right investment.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "The client realizes there is something important he doesn't yet understand about choosing the right investment."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [{"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Understanding that creating curiosity in the client is crucial."}], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "How confident do you feel that you're going to be able to kind of navigate and understand the market...", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000037"}], "text": "He needs to ask himself questions about his confidence in navigating the market based on real sales data."}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "Create a vacuum in the client's mind so they realize the importance of understanding the market, leading to more engagement."}, "title": "Creating a Mind Vacuum", "topic": "client engagement"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:c27b32f76ee5e96d", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Creating a Mind Vacuum", "topic": "client engagement", "topic_slug": "client-engagement"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000042"], "exceptions": [], "goal": {"citations": [{"quote": "So the client believes it? There is only one way, make the client pitch Dubai to himself by himself.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "The client believes in the potential of investing in Dubai."}, "kind": "method", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [{"citations": [{"quote": "what makes you feel that Dubai may be the right place for your investment, rather than invest in your own country?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "Ask, \"And what makes you feel that Dubai may be the right place for your investment, rather than invest in your own country?\""}], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "make the client pitch Dubai to himself by himself. Here's how.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000041"}], "text": "Ask questions that guide the client to self-pitch, increasing their investment interest."}, "title": "Question Construction", "topic": "sales strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:8bcece311f62d6cf", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Question Construction", "topic": "sales strategy", "topic_slug": "sales-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "advice", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "people only believe the words coming of their own mouth to their own ears.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000046"}], "text": "People tend to believe and commit to their own spoken words."}, "title": "Client Self-Pitching", "topic": "selling techniques"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:d5fd8f6cdfe355f5", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client Self-Pitching", "topic": "selling techniques", "topic_slug": "selling-techniques"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"constraints": [], "context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000047"], "exceptions": [], "goal": null, "kind": "offering", "prerequisites": [], "steps": [], "summary": {"citations": [{"quote": "I only have ten each month in my schedule. You could book from the link in the description.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000047"}], "text": "The speaker offers ten one-on-one sessions each month to help fix client lead conversion issues."}, "title": "Closing Session Offering", "topic": "service offering"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:knowledge:a30435e730d52f62", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "knowledge", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Closing Session Offering", "topic": "service offering", "topic_slug": "service-offering"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000028"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "This is where most agents go wrong. They pitch too early, recommend too early, present properties before the client understands his own decisions.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000026"}], "text": "The speaker describes how most agents approach clients too early without understanding their decisions."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "seventy two years old dad who doesn't speak English and never worked in sales knows what report is. It just doesn't work.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}, {"quote": "Instead, start with um hi name. Looks like you responded to one of the ads and asked us to call you back, possibly looking for help with investing in Dubai real estate or the project.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000027"}], "text": "Instead of starting with rapport like most agents, the speaker suggests engaging the client with curious questions to bring them back to the moment their intent was highest."}, "title": "Client Engagement Strategy", "topic": "sales strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:506d963db6400f46", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Client Engagement Strategy", "topic": "sales strategy", "topic_slug": "sales-strategy"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000029", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000030"], "cue": null, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": null, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "read it in a monotone and you will get a completely different answer.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000029"}], "text": "The speaker suggests that without the right tone, a conversation can result in less revealing answers from clients."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": null, "title": "Using Tone to Reveal Client Needs", "topic": "communication skills"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked", "extraction_scope": "source_excerpt", "id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:cases:a65f58fe203f3ce5", "metadata_hash": "b104ccc9726332292f3d9894baee68e612ef0c3f61b1dcafd52c755743bc795c", "product": "cases", "published_at": "2026-08-13", "semantic_status": "not_reviewed", "source_format": "transcript", "source_hash": "92a533e0bfae5db806ef3469e15dd8d191f8730753c7597ef6e96a49d1754ebf", "source_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c", "source_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQCLpcXSx2s", "title": "Using Tone to Reveal Client Needs", "topic": "communication skills", "topic_slug": "communication-skills"}
{"author": null, "category": "youtube", "content": {"context_unit_ids": ["youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000035", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000037", "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000038"], "cue": {"citations": [{"quote": "Question two, have you been to Dubai? Do you like Dubai?", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000035"}], "text": "Have you been to Dubai? Do you like Dubai?"}, "diagnosis": null, "kind": "illustration", "outcome": null, "rationale": null, "response": {"citations": [{"quote": "Well, I'm not sure.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000038"}], "text": "Most clients express uncertainty about their understanding of the market."}, "situation": {"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "The speaker describes creating curiosity in clients to engage them further in the investment process."}, "speaker_id": null, "strategy": {"citations": [{"quote": "Create a vacuum in the client mind.", "unit_id": "youtube-video-2026-08-13-4-questions-that-kill-your-dubai-real-estate-deals-in-2026-p-56bc27347c:u000036"}], "text": "The speaker suggests asking questions to make clients realize there is information they still need to understand, leading to the need for a further meeting."}, "title": "Creating Client Curiosity", "topic": "sales strategy"}, "content_hash": "077cf5899c2d49fa140edcdd32e511fb4f8105943dd82e965eb25b943257955a", "external_status": "not_checked"